+A visit's scientific fields include observation date, observer list, species cover estimates, and notes. Some edits are unrelated, such as correcting an observer name and adding a missing species. Other edits are related, such as revising a species identification and its cover estimate. The server cannot infer all such relationships from field names, so it never attempts to combine two submissions on its own — every submission stands as a complete, whole-visit revision, and a coordinator decides how competing revisions are resolved.
 
